WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.520
…normal day and skip the parts where you're talking or deciding or solving something.

2
00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:09.760
Look at what's left, the stretches where your body is busy and your mind is mostly

3
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:18.760
idling. Driving to work. Walking the dog. The treadmill. Folding laundry, washing dishes,

4
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:24.200
mowing the lawn. Your eyes are on the road or the sidewalk or the pile of socks, but

5
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:29.060
your mind is off somewhere, replaying a conversation from yesterday or fretting about tomorrow's

6
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:35.260
meeting or just drifting. That's reading time. You've had it all along and never used

7
00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:35.500
it.
